sheet Box added
Box!A1 = 1
Box!A2 = 2
Box!B1 = 3
C1 = 6
C2 = 5
deps C1: Box!A1 Box!A2 Box!B1 Box!B2
deps C2: Box!A1 Box!A2 Box!B1 Box!B2
users Box!B2: C1 C2
users Box!A2: C1 C2
users C2: none
using Box
users A2: Sheet1!C1 Sheet1!C2
deps Sheet1!C2: A1 A2 B1 B2
using Sheet1
dropped Box
deps C1: none
users C1: none
C1: =SUM(#REF!A1:B2)
C2 = #REF
cells 2, formulas 2, errors 2
